From f2f63df6f137980e099a60249311ed8d7f11405a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JingMatrix <jingmatrix@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 21:20:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/47] Configure the TA per attestation profile

Add TaConfig and teesim_km_init_ex so a profile's security level, patch and OS levels, verified-boot fields, and attestation IDs are passed in rather than hard-coded, plus an AttestIds device trait to vouch for them. teesim_km_init keeps the historical defaults.
